    "significance": "Behrens invented the profession of industrial design before the term existed. The AEG kettle programme proves that mass production and aesthetic variety are not opposites — the same structural logic can support multiple expressions. Gropius, Mies, and Le Corbusier all worked in his office. The kettle is where modern design begins.",
