        "reason": "Hadid's Vitra Fire Station (1993) uses angular concrete to destabilise the ground plane — deconstructivism as provocation. BIG's VIA 57 West (2016) uses angular massing to hybridise building types — pragmatism as invention. Both produce striking forms from tilted planes, but Hadid disorients while Ingels accommodates."
